Wow, it's really windy!

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:03.380
Ayaka, are we really going to eat here?

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.130
Yeah, it's kind of chilly.

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.990
Let's head back to the classroom.

00:19:08.990 --> 00:19:09.810
Yeah!

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:13.370
I'm getting something to drink.
You can go without me.

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:18.050
Thank god. If I eat here, my skirt will...

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:22.770
I can't stay here!

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:24.300
I have to get back!

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:25.120
Huh?

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:27.840
Are you eating lunch?

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:31.080
Ugh! How does he do that?

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:33.060
I have to get back inside!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:34.180
Look.

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:38.310
Can you tell me why you're so angry?

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:41.310
I'm listening, so let's talk.

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:45.190
N-<i>Now's </i>really <i>not a good time for that!</i>

00:19:47.650 --> 00:19:50.110
Wh-<i>What now?</i>

00:19:50.110 --> 00:19:52.870
Please, let go of my hand!

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:54.800
Come on, say something!

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:55.710
Hey!

00:19:57.510 --> 00:19:59.710
You're bothering Mitsuki.

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:01.420
Buy a clue, doofus!

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:03.900
Y-Yuki-nee?

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:05.380
Yukina-san...

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:07.340
She's changed.

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:10.910
What did I tell you? This is the real her!

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:12.330
The real her?

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:17.850
Every girl wants to look good down there, but don't catch a cold over it.

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:21.170
Okay?

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:25.900
It's like... Yukina-<i>san's </i>my<i> big sister.</i>

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:40.210
F...

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:43.500
Freaky... panties?

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:48.520
Hey, Yuu-kun? Are you all right?

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:52.220
Yuu-kun! Stay with me!

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:06.360
Onii-chan saw it!

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:09.830
You need help if you actually enjoyed that.

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:12.750
I want the man I love to see <i>everything!</i>

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:16.780
And don't worry. Onii-chan thinks he imagined that.

00:21:16.780 --> 00:21:19.000
Yeah, not in a million years.

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:23.620
What's that?

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:25.180
I don't know.

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:30.090
More underwear?

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:33.870
What is this? Who would...

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:37.000
This is great! You can really use it!

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:38.160
Yeah.

00:21:40.720 --> 00:21:43.530
I heard you hit your head. You holding up?

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:47.340
I think I saw... something unusual.

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:53.860
Please hug me tight.

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:56.460
The man of my dreams with the charming do.

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:59.340
Come closer to me.

00:21:59.340 --> 00:22:02.220
Let’s make things more exciting.

00:22:13.320 --> 00:22:15.540
I want you to notice

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:18.780
how much I feel like flailing about.

00:22:18.780 --> 00:22:21.080
I’ll gather up whatever courage I have

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:24.240
and go full throttle towards you.

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:26.610
Whenever a girl gets serious,

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:29.830
you can’t imagine how far she’ll go.

00:22:29.830 --> 00:22:32.090
Raise the readings of my heart-shaped gauge

00:22:32.090 --> 00:22:35.170
and take me beyond the clouds.

00:22:35.170 --> 00:22:37.800
These ordinary days

00:22:37.800 --> 00:22:40.680
are something special to me.

00:22:40.680 --> 00:22:46.180
They’re like miracles covered in light.

00:22:46.180 --> 00:22:51.900
If I don’t act now, my feelings will stay bottled up.

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:57.320
It's painful regretting what could have been.

00:22:57.320 --> 00:23:00.030
You’re my man with the charming do

00:23:00.030 --> 00:23:02.810
who makes my heart throb like no one else.

00:23:02.810 --> 00:23:05.520
Well you see, that’s because

00:23:05.520 --> 00:23:08.540
I love you very much.

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:11.080
You make my heart race whenever I’m with you.

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:13.750
But your charming do makes me stronger.

00:23:13.750 --> 00:23:16.620
I want to keep on loving you

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:19.250
always and forever more.

00:23:20.280 --> 00:23:23.990
Next time on <i>Recently,
My Sister Is Unusual:</i>

00:23:24.430 --> 00:23:26.290
It might not
taste that good.

00:23:26.310 --> 00:23:29.170
D-Don't stare. It's
embarrassing me.

00:23:33.110 --> 00:23:34.510
I'm just kidding!

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:38.010
We'll never get busy with Onii-chan with <i>that</i> attitude.

00:23:38.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Can you sleep with me tonight?
